{{Codex|Cyte-09’s signature rifle is an ideal match for forceful gunners. A precisely timed reload increases reload speed and infuses the new magazine with Heat Damage.}}
'''Reconifex''' is {{WF|Cyte-09}}'s [[Signature Weapon|signature]] heavy assault rifle. Pressing the reload button between the outlined brackets will speed up the reload and load the gun with {{D|Heat}} bullets.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Pressing the reload button while between '''22%''' to '''38%''' of the way through a reload will decrease the reload time to '''1''' second and grant the current magazine {{D|Heat}} rounds that inflict '''25%''' more damage with guaranteed status.
**Perfect reload range is indicated by white brackets.

{{Advantages|}}
{{Disadvantages|}}

{{Acquisition|Reconifex's main blueprint is awarded from Tier 5 [[Höllvania Central Mall]] [[Bounty|Bounties]] as a rare drop, requiring the completion of [[The Hex (Quest)|The Hex]] to access. The Barrel, Receiver, and Stock are awarded from [[Höllvania]] [[Legacyte Harvest]] and [[Hell-Scrub]].

Alternatively Reconifex's blueprints can be purchased from [[Amir]] of {{Faction|The Hex}} for {{sc|Standing}}; component blueprints for {{sc|5,000}} and the main blueprint for {{sc|15,000}}, all requiring '''Rank 4 - Hot & Fresh'''.}}

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

==Notes==
*The bonus damage is added as an [[Extra Hit]] that deals 25% of the initial hit's damage as pure {{D|Heat}} damage with a guaranteed status effect.
**The extra hit's damage cannot crit, or have its element changed, but does take into account critical and elemental damage increases of any type to the initial hit.
***This means that the forced {{D|Heat}} status' damage is affected '''both''' by Heat damage bonuses, and elemental damage bonuses, ''including Heat.''
**[[Faction Damage Bonus]] is applied once each to the initial hit, the extra hit, and the forced status, each application multiplicative with the previous.
**Other damage modifiers such as [[Status_Effect#Status_Damage_2|Status Damage]], [[Enemy Body Parts|Weakpoint Damage]], [[Damage Vulnerability]], and Damage Efficacy behave normally and apply once.
*{{WF|Oraxia}}'s {{A|Silken Stride}}'s {{D|Toxin}} damage will override the {{D|Heat}} bonus.
*{{WF|Uriel}}'s {{A|Demonium}} runes will cause the Reconifex's innate {{D|Heat}} bonus to be removed when the buff expires.

